#: ../../../lib/web/src/components/restore-banner.tsx
msgid "Your account was moved here from {source}. Until you delete it there, messages and notifications may reach both servers, some of your content keeps being served from the old server, and followers may take a few minutes to find you here."
msgstr "Hisobingiz {source} dan bu yerga ko'chirildi. U yerdan o'chirmaguncha, xabarlar va bildirishnomalar ikkala serverga ham yetishi mumkin, ba'zi kontentingiz eski serverdan erilib berilishda davom etadi va kuzatuvchilar sizni bu yerda topish uchun bir necha daqiqa vaqt ketishi mumkin."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be permanently deleted on {purgeDate}. You've been signed out. To cancel, sign in again before then."
msgstr "Hisobingiz {purgeDate} sanasida butunlay oʻchiriladi. Siz tizimdan chiqdingiz. Bekor qilish uchun, shu sanagacha qaytadan kiring."

#: src/features/user/close-account.tsx
msgid "Your account will be scheduled for deletion and you'll be signed out. You can cancel any time before the deletion date by logging back in. Download your data first if you want to keep a copy."
msgstr "Hisobingiz o'chirilishi uchun rejalashtiriladi va tizimdan chiqarilasiz. O'chirish sanasidan oldin istalgan vaqtda qaytadan tizimga kirib, buni bekor qilishingiz mumkin. Nusxasini saqlamoqchi bo'lsangiz, avval ma'lumotlaringizni yuklab oling."

